                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Early, buggy, but scary! It's the first time I've genuinely flinched while in VR and tried to defend myself with the controllers - even though I knew it was coming and obviously wasn't real! I've played all of the other various zombie games etc., and although this is nowhere near as polished or realistic as most of those (yet), the scene and atmosphere setting is done just right.\n\nA tense build up, and then a moment of acute tangible terror. I was actually panicking and rushing to get back in the car at one point because I could sense things weren't going to end well.\n\nI'll be following the progress of this game. The developer clearly knows how to get people on edge and freak them out.\n\nWell worth the small price at the moment.",
